sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  title: Watchdog and outbox cleanup
  participant S as Retry Timer
  participant W as Watchdog
  participant O as Outbox KV
  participant P as Presence
  participant R as Worker Session
  participant C as Cleanup

  S->>W: every 15 seconds
  W->>O: list delivered task records (rejected excluded)
  O-->>W: unacked candidates
  loop each candidate
    W->>P: read worker presence
    alt worker idle
      W->>R: send system nudge
      W->>O: record nudge count
    else running or unknown
      W->>W: skip candidate
    end
  end
  S->>C: hourly check
  C->>O: find expired records
  alt postal_cleanup tool (default)
    C-->>C: dry run, report only
  else background timer or dryRun false
    C->>O: remove expired records and receipts
    C->>O: keep sender-scoped msg markers
  end
